<%- include('partials/header') %>
<main class="solutions-page">
<section class="section solutions-hero"><span class="kicker">BUSINESS SERVICES</span><h1>Wall clock supply built around the way your organisation buys.</h1><p>Choose a route for wholesale sourcing, corporate gifting, promotional branding or custom/OEM requirements. Each service starts with the quantity, product direction and delivery requirement.</p></section>
<section class="section solutions-grid-section"><div class="solution-index"><span class="kicker">HOW OSIRA CAN HELP</span><span><%= services.length %> services</span></div><div class="service-grid service-grid-v2"><% services.forEach((service,i)=>{ %><a class="service-card service-card-v2" href="/services/<%= service.slug %>"><span class="solution-number"><%= String(i+1).padStart(2,'0') %></span><div><span class="kicker"><%= service.iconClass || 'OSIRA' %></span><h2><%= service.h1Heading %></h2><p><%= service.shortDescription %></p><strong>Explore service →</strong></div></a><% }) %></div></section>
<section class="section solution-note"><div><span class="kicker">START WITH THE REQUIREMENT</span><h2>Quantity, application, size and branding are the useful starting points.</h2></div><div><p>For business orders, commercial terms can depend on product selection, quantity, artwork, packaging and delivery destination. Send those details and confirm the current quotation before ordering.</p><a class="btn primary" href="/#enquiry">Request a quotation</a></div></section>
</main><%- include('partials/footer',{site}) %>